<h1>Comments</h1>

{* This line is a comment and will not appear in the output *}

<p>Hello {$name}!{* this comment is removed inline *}</p>

{*
  Multi-line comments are useful for
  temporarily disabling blocks of template code:

  <p>{$name}</p>
*}

{* Variables inside comments are not evaluated: {$name} *}

{* Comments {* can be *} nested *}

<p>Everything above this line is comments, so none of it reaches the output.</p>
